{"about_the_game":"Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls</li></ul><br>Assemble your team of legendary Marvel characters in the ultimate 4v4 tag team fighter from PlayStation Studios, Arc System Works and Marvel Games.<br><br>It\u2019s time to build your dream team and break some spirits in blistering 4v4 fighting action. Choose from an expanding roster of 20 iconic Marvel characters at launch, each rendered in a bold new anime-inspired art style and members of their own unique teams of equally impressive heroes and villains.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.poster.avif?t=1771572149\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.webm?t=1771572149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.mp4?t=1771572149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Experiment with team compositions to discover new combos, synergies, and strategies. Blast your way through dynamic stages based on iconic Marvel Universe locales, some featuring interactive stage transitions.<br><br>Fighting is both immersive and intuitive, with a range of unique move sets, combos, and strategies to master. Adjustable controls, both traditional and quick inputs, plus easy chain combos make diving right in a breeze.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/abfdd4740473c141f3c5eacbf3b7ea92.poster.avif?t=1771572149\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/abfdd4740473c141f3c5eacbf3b7ea92.webm?t=1771572149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/abfdd4740473c141f3c5eacbf3b7ea92.mp4?t=1771572149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Face off against a friend locally or join the fray with up to 64 players in the online\u00b2 lobby, including standard VS modes. Plus, dive deep on each team with the single player Episode Mode to learn more about team dynamics and lore.<br><br>\u00b2Internet connection and account for PlayStation required.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PC feature</h2><strong>Ultra Settings</strong><br><br>Experience the action of MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls at high performance rates of 60fps (locked in battle) and super crisp 4K\u00b3 visuals.<br><br>\u00b34K requires compatible 4K TV or display.<br><br><strong>DualSense\u00ae controller support</strong><br><br>MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls features full use of the DualSense\u2074 controller on PC.<br><br>\u2074For DualSense controller, wired connection required to experience the full range of in-game controller features.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787240?t=1771572149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787240?t=1771572149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/02cce26298f101323accfb81984a1c339301fe82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771572149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/02cce26298f101323accfb81984a1c339301fe82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771572149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Pre-purchase any edition of MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls to receive\u00b9:</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Infinity Gauntlet (Lobby Equipment)<br></li><li>Baby Groot (Lobby Pet)<br></li><li>Cosmic Surfboard (Lobby Ride)</li></ul><br>\u00b9Account for PlayStation and Internet connection required to redeem.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/e776ac4298206b64186b0fe61e380354.avif?t=1771572149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras_big/e776ac4298206b64186b0fe61e380354.avif?t=1771572149 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><br><h1>MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls Digital Deluxe Edition</h1><p>Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls<br></li><li>Year 1 Characters and Stage Pass\u00b2 (Includes four characters and one stage post-launch)<br></li><li>Howard the Duck (Lobby Avatar) and Cosmo (Lobby Pet)</li></ul><br>\u00b2Contents for the Year 1 Character and Stage Pass expected to be made available by 12/31/2027. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/f3feaddb8bfe2f93c15b8eeec29e1beb.avif?t=1771572149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras_big/f3feaddb8bfe2f93c15b8eeec29e1beb.avif?t=1771572149 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><br><h1>MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls Ultimate Edition</h1><p>Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls<br></li><li>Year 1 Characters and Stage Pass\u00b2 (Includes four characters and one stage post-launch)<br></li><li>Howard the Duck (Lobby Avatar)<br></li><li>Cosmo (Lobby Pet)<br></li><li>Spider-Man \u201cAdvanced Suit 2.0\u201d Costume<br></li><li>Storm Punk Rock Costume<br></li><li>Iron Man Classic Costume<br></li><li>Captain America Classic Costume<br></li><li>Doctor Doom Supreme Ruler Costume<br></li><li>Animated Chromatic color unlock\u00b2 for all 20 launch characters</li></ul><br>\u00b2Contents for the Year 1 Character and Stage Pass expected to be made available by 12/31/2027. Costumes available until August 5, 2027. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/4de1f6f29c6a4aff31ca0b7fa6597031.avif?t=1771572149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras_big/4de1f6f29c6a4aff31ca0b7fa6597031.avif?t=1771572149 width=1560 height=1560 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Edition includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> MARVEL T\u014dkon: Fighting Souls</li></ul><br>Assemble your team of legendary Marvel characters in the ultimate 4v4 tag team fighter from PlayStation Studios, Arc System Works and Marvel Games.<br><br>It\u2019s time to build your dream team and break some spirits in blistering 4v4 fighting action. Choose from an expanding roster of 20 iconic Marvel characters at launch, each rendered in a bold new anime-inspired art style and members of their own unique teams of equally impressive heroes and villains.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.poster.avif?t=1771572149\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.webm?t=1771572149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787240/extras/ce5219ea73147d94a04a58591d35614d.mp4?t=1771572149\" type=\"vide